Error [E0362]: Compound assignment can't target a nested operator field
  --> tests/ui/operator_nested_compound.jet:28:17
    |
 28 |     outer.inner.value += Vec2{x: 3, y: 4}
    |                 ^^^^^
 Why: The current operator-place lowering supports one named owner and one field
 Fix: Bind the inner value, update it, then assign the whole inner value back
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0362

